# The image builds from the repository root (see Dockerfile): only the
# dashboard's sources and the app's ARB files go into the context.
*
!financial-manager-web/
!financial-manager-app/lib/l10n/*.arb
financial-manager-web/node_modules/
financial-manager-web/dist/
financial-manager-web/.angular/
financial-manager-web/public/i18n/
financial-manager-web/test-results/
financial-manager-web/playwright-report/
**/.DS_Store
